/target
*.zip

# Round-trip test corpus: PA flow exports, which carry tenant identifiers,
# user IDs, SharePoint URLs and internal flow names until they are scrubbed.
# NEVER commit, scrubbed or not -- the corpus lives in the private
# excelano/paxc-testing and arrives here as a clone or a symlink.
#
# No trailing slash, deliberately. A pattern ending in `/` matches only a
# real directory, and this is a symlink on the machine it is developed on,
# so the slashed form silently stopped covering it.
tests/corpus
